sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Console (BFF)
  participant GW as gateway
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant AG as agent
  participant MO as mcp-observability
  participant MK as gateway /mcp
  participant L as LLM (optional)
  U->>GW: POST /api/v1/incidents (user JWT)
  GW->>GW: verify JWT · tenant from claim · rate limit
  GW->>DB: INSERT incident INVESTIGATING (RLS-bound)
  GW->>GW: mint tool token (tenant, knowledge:read, 15 min)
  GW->>AG: POST /incidents + traceparent + X-Sentinel-Tool-Token
  loop until done, 8 tool calls, or $0.50
    AG->>L: next step? (or scripted plan)
    par parallel tool calls
      AG->>MO: deploys / error logs / metrics
    and
      AG->>MK: search_runbooks (Bearer tool token)
    end
    AG->>AG: sanitize output · record evidence · checkpoint
  end
  AG->>L: triage (cheap model) → RCA (strong model)
  AG->>AG: validate citations · policy interlocks · interrupt()
  AG-->>GW: view: AWAITING_APPROVAL
  GW->>DB: UPDATE status, proposed action, RCA
  GW-->>U: view
